# Claude Code Instructions

Use HolyHouse Harness as the repository governance layer.

## Startup

- Read `.holyhouse/METODOLOGIA.md`.
- Read `.holyhouse/HARNESS.md`.
- Read `.holyhouse/GATES.md`.
- Read `.holyhouse/STATE.md`.
- Read `.holyhouse/MEMORY.md`.
- Read `.holyhouse/DECISIONS.md`.
- Follow `.holyhouse/AGENT_CONTRACT.md`.

## Work Style

Plan with GSD context, execute with Superpowers discipline, verify through gates, and update living documentation when the repository learns something durable.
